OL,3,AMore than 800 missing in Nepal as
OL,4,Aauthorities say glacial collapse
OL,5,Atriggered flash flood
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 800 people are missing in
OL,8,FNepal after a massive flash flood on
OL,9,Fthe border with Tibet
OL,11,FAt least 165 bodies have been recovered
OL,12,Fso far in Nepal, with rescue efforts
OL,13,Fcomplicated by rain and geography
OL,15,FIn Tibet, at least 558 people are
OL,16,Fmissing, with three confirmed dead -
OL,17,Fit's not clear if these figures overlap
OL,18,Fwith Nepal's
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
