OL,3,AMore than 800 missing in Nepal as
OL,4,Aauthorities say glacial collapse
OL,5,Atriggered flash flood
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn both sides of the border, hundreds
OL,8,Fof foreign nationals are missing -
OL,9,FNepal says that includes more than 100
OL,10,Ftourists from India, 54 from the US,
OL,11,Fand 33 from the UK
OL,13,FThe US Geological Survey says "glacial
OL,14,Fcollapse and debris flow" triggered the
OL,15,Ffloods
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
